OL,3,GNEWSAChild abuse trial of snooker
OL,4,Achampion Graeme Dott hears closing
OL,5,Aarguments
OL,6,
OL,7,FJurors have heard closing arguments in
OL,8,Fthe child abuse trial of former world
OL,9,Fsnooker champion Graeme Dott.
OL,11,FDott, 49, is accused of lewd and
OL,12,Flibidinous behaviour towards a girl and
OL,13,Fboy between 1993 and 2010. He denies
OL,14,Fthe charges.
OL,16,FProsecutor Lindsey Dalziel told the
OL,17,FHigh Court in Glasgow that "brave and
OL,18,Fcompelling" witnesses had given
OL,19,Fevidence of him preying upon the
OL,20,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
