OL,3,GNEWSAChild abuse trial of snooker
OL,4,Achampion Graeme Dott hears closing
OL,5,Aarguments
OL,6,
OL,7,FDott's lawyer, Euan Dow, said emotions
OL,8,Fin such cases were natural, and urged
OL,9,Fjurors to not to decide the verdicts on
OL,10,F"hunches" or "suspicions".
